<title>SPAIN: Acerinox to pay interim 100 pta gross div.</title>
<headline>Acerinox to pay interim 100 pta gross div.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish steel producer Acerinox said it would pay an interim 100 peseta gross dividend per share effective October 1.</p>
<p>Last year, the company paid two interim dividends of 100 pesets per share each and a final dividend of 200 pesetas per share.</p>
<p>Acerinox said its board of directors approved a capital reduction at the annual shareholders meeting in June which reduces the nominal value of shares to 900 pesetas from 1,000.</p>
<p>- Madrid newsroom 341-585-2160</p>
</text>
